          "explanation": "The doctor gave patient-specific phrasing that reframed the visit around sleep and medication clarity rather than illness or coercion.",
          "quote": "看看有没有办法让你晚上睡得舒服一点"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00162",
          "explanation": "The family reported that the adapted wording changed the patient’s trajectory enough to get dressed and agree to go.",
          "quote": "她算是松口了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by an 18-year-old patient with persecutory sensitivity and medication refusal. The doctor went beyond generic reassurance by crafting low-control, autonomy-preserving language and it meaningfully enabled presentation for assessment.",
