          "quote": "不要鸣笛，到了楼下先打我这个电话"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00513",
          "explanation": "The plan was actually executed successfully with low-stimulation emergency arrival.",
          "quote": "120已经来了。没鸣笛"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by unreadable orders, family conflict, inability to safely leave home, and patient paranoia. The doctor created executable steps for records, family roles, text contact, and later safe transfer, with direct trajectory impact.",
