      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by the patient’s claim that medication would make her stupid. The doctor distinguished manageable sedation/slow reaction from brain damage, while maintaining that stopping medication increases relapse risk.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
