          "explanation": "The doctor integrated refusal, auditory/visual suspicion of family contact, and safety logistics instead of treating it as ordinary noncompliance.",
          "quote": "她听觉现在特别敏感"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00367",
          "explanation": "The doctor incorporated ongoing refusal, poor sleep, and high vigilance into a written-contact plan with the original psychiatric channel.",
          "quote": "患者目前仍拒药、睡眠差、警觉高"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by refusal in the setting of persecutory ideas. The doctor actively elicited and integrated the patient’s interpretation of calls, medication reminders, family discussion, and being taken out, which shaped communication and escalation.",
